      "agent_response": {
        "response": "The **Q3 2026 Business Report** for **Meridian Analytics** is now open. Here's a summary of what it contains:\n\n---\n\n**Period:** July 1 \u2013 September 7, 2026\n**Prepared by:** Rachel Kim (VP of Sales) & Claire Fontaine (CFO)\n\n### Executive Summary\n- 14 deals closed out of 22 opportunities \u2192 **$1,040,000** in new contract value\n- Healthy pipeline with high-value deals still pending\n- All critical support tickets resolved same-day\n\n### Sales Performance\n- **South region** led all territories at **$468,000**\n- Three-person field sales team: James Okafor, Sofia Delgado, Marcus Webb\n- **63.6% win rate** (above the 55% target)\n- ~$240,000 in pending deals expected to close by end of September\n\n### Key Highlights\n- **Top deal:** $198,000 Meridian Insights Pro contract closed by Sofia Delgado (D019)\n- **Headcount:** 15 employees across 5 departments (Sales 4, Engineering 5, Product 3, HR 1, Finance 2)\n- **Support SLA:** All critical tickets (TKT-004, TKT-011, TKT-015) resolved within 24 hours\n- **License utilisation:** SKU-001 at 94% capacity \u2014 procurement review in October\n\n### Next Steps\n1. Close pending deals (D007, D013, D020, D022) before Q3 end\n2. Begin Q4 pipeline review \u2014 target $1.2M in new ARR\n3. Resolve open support tickets (TKT-013, TKT-016, TKT-019)\n4. License capacity review for SKU-001 and SKU-003 in early October\n5. HR to initiate two new engineering hire approvals with Kenji Obi\n\n---\n\nLet me know if you'd like to edit, analyze, or take any action on this report!",
